  "ALL_TEXT": "81 EXT. ABANDONED PARK - DAY \nThe BUM is sitting on a park bench, briefcase in hand. He is \nexerting all his might to open the briefcase - he tries \nwrecking it with his hands but can\u2019t do. He hammers it with a \nrock, but only hits his own thumb. He tries prying it open \nwith the edge of the park bench, but fails. His attention \ngets diverted when he sees a dried up water fountain as the \nparks center-piece - it is a mermaid. He walks towards it, \nwicked smile transfixed on him, and leans in to kiss it. \nCUT TO:",
